write_section.prompt:
Write the following section of the PRD for {product_name}:

Section: {section_pick}

Problem: {problem_statement}
Personas: {user_personas}
Constraints: {constraints}

PRD outline:
{prd_outline}

Relevant findings from memory:
{section_findings}

Write a complete, polished draft of this section. Follow PRD best practices:
- User stories: 'As a [persona], I want [goal], so that [benefit]'
- Requirements: numbered, with priority (Must/Should/Could/Won't)
- Non-functional: measurable acceptance criteria
- Milestones: clear scope and timeline

Use markdown formatting.
